  "description": "<h4 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 17.5px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-weight: var(--font-weight-header); line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: calc(((var(--font-h4-desktop)) / (var(--font-size-base))) * 1em); color: rgb(51, 50, 50);\">Welcome to Pimp Shrimp Clothing Co.! We’re a casual, coastal lifestyle apparel brand designed for the young, the young at heart, and people who appreciate all that coastal life has to offer.</h4><h4 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 17.5px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-weight: var(--font-weight-header); line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: calc(((var(--font-h4-desktop)) / (var(--font-size-base))) * 1em); color: rgb(51, 50, 50);\">Our branding says fun, and our hats and tees are the finest quality on the market. Whether you’re on the water, drinking a cold one, or just hangin’ with the ones you love, Pimp Shrimp Clothing says that you’re enjoying yourself, you look great, and you’re on \"beach time\". Yes, we’re about a lifestyle! As a business, Pimp Shrimp is all about exceeding customer expectations.</h4><h4 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 17.5px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-weight: var(--font-weight-header); line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: calc(((var(--font-h4-desktop)) / (var(--font-size-base))) * 1em); color: rgb(51, 50, 50);\">Our mission is to ALWAYS offer great quality goods with fresh and fun designs for the best value! We invite you to enjoy the ride with us at Pimp Shrimp Clothing Co....one wave at a time!<br><br>We Donate a portion of every sale to The Coastal Federation to help with beach and ocean cleanup.</h4><h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 17.5px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-weight: var(--font-weight-header); line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: calc(((var(--font-size-header)) / (var(--font-size-base))) * 1em); color: rgb(51, 50, 50);\">Founders,<br>Bryan Berry<br>Jeno Cossette</h3>",
